### List All Models (Chat + Audio)
GET http://localhost:5164/v1/models

### List Chat Models Only
GET http://localhost:5164/v1/models/chat

### List Audio Models Only
GET http://localhost:5164/v1/models/audio

### Get Specific Chat Model Info
GET http://localhost:5164/v1/models/llama-3.2-3b-instruct

### Get Specific Audio Model Info
GET http://localhost:5164/v1/models/tiny

### Get Whisper-1 Model Info (Alias for base)
GET http://localhost:5164/v1/models/whisper-1

### Chat with Different Models
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "llama-3.2-1b-instruct",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "Hello! Which model are you?"}],
  "max_tokens": 50
}

### Audio Transcription with Tiny Model (Fastest)
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/audio/transcriptions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< path/to/test.wav
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

tiny
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="response_format"

json
--boundary--

### Audio Transcription with Base Model (Default)
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/audio/transcriptions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.mp3"
Content-Type: audio/mpeg

< path/to/test.mp3
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

whisper-1
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="response_format"

json
--boundary--

### Audio Transcription with Large Model (Best Quality)
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/audio/transcriptions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.flac"
Content-Type: audio/flac

< path/to/test.flac
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

large-v3
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="response_format"

json
--boundary--

### Test Invalid Models (Should Return Errors)

# Invalid Chat Model
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/chat/completions
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "model": "nonexistent-chat-model",
  "messages": [{"role": "user", "content": "This should fail"}]
}

### Invalid Audio Model
POST http://localhost:5164/v1/audio/transcriptions
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=boundary

--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.wav"
Content-Type: audio/wav

< path/to/test.wav
--boundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="model"

nonexistent-whisper-model
--boundary--